ounty"],["ARC or PLC in Fremont County","/arc-plc/colorado/fremont-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, every pair of months published so far for 2026 came in under 90% of normal on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, with March to April 2026 at 56% and May to June 2026 and June to July 2026 at 59%. Over 75 years of record since 1951, March to April and April to May each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years on the middle. Grid 22001 had its driest year in 2002 at 46%.</p>"}
